WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
- Last one, B.

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.210
- [Gavin] Last one.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.772
- [Daniel] Okay, we're good.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.022
- [Gavin] Whoa!

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.630
- Hello everyone, I'm Gav.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.530
- I'm Dan.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.670
- We're the Slo Mo Guys and
we're incredibly on edge,

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:14.620
right now.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.610
- Yeah.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:16.443
I'm nervous.

00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:17.730
- Why are you nervous?

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.060
- Well, it's not just
because I'm about to jump

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:20.960
into a load of mousetraps,

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.110
it's because I don't want
them to go off before I do.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.040
- Yeah.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.120
- This took hours.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.880
- We've spent four hours doing this.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.380
We had a couple of calamities.

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:36.514
- [Gavin] No!

00:00:43.106 --> 00:00:44.754
- [Daniel] What even
happened, how did that do it?

00:00:44.754 --> 00:00:46.149
Was it the one I was pushing?

00:00:46.149 --> 00:00:47.630
- [Gavin] I don't know, didn't see.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:51.660
But now Dan is ready to
leap from that ladder,

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.990
onto the trampoline, full of

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.370
I'd assume a thousand mouse traps--

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.090
- I think there is about
a thousand we've done now.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.240
- Someone could freeze frame and count.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.320
Let's get out the way.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.023
All right, good luck counting.

00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:04.730
Dan, you ready?

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.090
- Yeah, I just want to
get on with it let's go.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:06.923
- Good luck.

00:01:06.923 --> 00:01:07.952
- Thank you very much.

00:01:07.952 --> 00:01:08.785
- I did offer to do it though didn't I?

00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:09.780
- He did, he did.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:10.613
- I would have done it.

00:01:10.613 --> 00:01:12.370
- Yeah, but I didn't want to
mess up the button trigger.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.040
I didn't want that responsibility.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.873
- Oh god.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.800
- [Daniel] I don't think their
could possibly be a jankier

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.803
table to jump off.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.483
This is like, horrendous.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.460
- Don't try this at home ladies and gents.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.160
- [Daniel] I'm ready to
go into the mousetraps B.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.880
- [Gavin] Okay. Go for it.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.713
- You ready?

00:01:37.713 --> 00:01:38.546
- [Gavin] Yep.

00:02:25.686 --> 00:02:27.259
- [Gavin] Yep.

00:02:27.259 --> 00:02:28.592
- [Daniel] Woah!

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.746
It's in my hair!

00:02:32.748 --> 00:02:34.423
- [Gavin] Oh my god!

00:02:39.935 --> 00:02:41.760
- God! Flip!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.160
- [Gavin] How was that?

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.210
I think they all went off.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:46.409
- I think so.

00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:47.242
- [Gavin] I think they all went off.

00:02:47.242 --> 00:02:48.075
- Goodness me.

00:02:48.075 --> 00:02:49.600
- [Gavin] It's actually in your hair.

00:02:51.158 --> 00:02:52.750
Wait, where did the goggles go?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:53.583
- I didn't put them on.

00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:54.500
- [Gavin] You didn't put the goggles on?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.513
- I forgot!

00:02:55.513 --> 00:02:56.346
- [Gavin] You're a maniac.

00:02:56.346 --> 00:02:57.179
- No I was too excited I was like --

00:02:57.179 --> 00:02:58.012
- [Gavin] Oh god!

00:02:58.012 --> 00:02:59.760
- I just sort of closed my eyes and hoped.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.440
- [Gavin] We had them, where were they?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.390
Oh they're on here.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.267
- [Daniel] Oh, I got too excited.

00:03:07.394 --> 00:03:08.227
- [Gavin] Did that hurt?

00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:10.430
- Well I just got like
little nips all over my body.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.263
- [Gavin] Yeah.

00:03:11.263 --> 00:03:12.400
- Wasn't like, anything really painful.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.618
It was actually kind of comfy.

00:03:13.618 --> 00:03:14.451
- [Gavin] Ah.

00:03:14.451 --> 00:03:15.840
- The main thing was
falling into the trampoline,

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:16.673
to be honest.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:19.674
I'll just keep this here now.

00:03:21.075 --> 00:03:22.540
Ah man, did they all go off?

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.510
- [Gavin] I think they all went off.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:25.343
- That one didn't, let me see.

00:03:25.343 --> 00:03:27.694
Shall I see how many of them
need to go off, hang on.

00:03:34.513 --> 00:03:35.558
I think they all went off.

00:03:35.558 --> 00:03:37.070
Look at that, you can
tell I gave it my all.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.120
That is dodgy.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:42.417
- [Gavin] God, you almost
Captain Video'd yourself.

00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:44.443
- I did what, almost like yeah.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.860
- [Gavin] Look at that.

00:03:48.298 --> 00:03:49.973
- I wasn't worried I just went for it.

00:03:49.973 --> 00:03:51.420
- [Gavin] That was a
tremendous performance Dan.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.773
I can't believe you
did it without goggles.

00:03:54.738 --> 00:03:58.783
- Yeah I know, I was just
like I wanna do it, let's go.

00:04:00.461 --> 00:04:02.840
- [Daniel] At this
point, my fate is sealed.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.890
- [Gavin] It's one of those
things where it's like--

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.643
- [Daniel] There's nothing I can do.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.757
- [Gavin] It was at this point he knew

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:20.343
You're in, your hands are in, ugh!

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:22.653
You're like going through them.

00:04:22.653 --> 00:04:26.115
- [Daniel] All of them have
stayed still and then whoa!

00:04:26.115 --> 00:04:27.677
Oh man.

00:04:27.677 --> 00:04:30.060
- [Both] Oh my god!

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.890
- [Daniel] They all started
from the outside and went in.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:34.260
- [Gavin] That's so cool, it
looked like a speaker cone.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:35.093
- [Daniel] Yeah!

00:04:36.093 --> 00:04:38.497
- [Gavin] Look at that crumpled heap!

00:04:38.497 --> 00:04:39.980
- [Daniel] All flown up in the air now.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.250
Everything bounces back.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.620
- [Gavin] That was tremendous B.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.840
- [Daniel] My legs are still
up in the air still now.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.940
- [Gavin] That was class!

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.300
I look like some mysterious
sort of silhouette man.

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.620
- Yeah you haven't unlocked
your character yet.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.510
- So I realize I did the
intro wearing a cowboy hat

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:56.240
and I didn't mention the cowboy hat.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:59.380
Which means the audience
thinks that I thought I

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.660
could pull off a cowboy hat.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.740
- Yeah you definitely can't.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.900
- I know, in reality it was
sunny and I was just trying

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.190
to wear a hat, and this
is my new favorite hat.

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:08.023
- This is my new favorite hat.

00:05:08.023 --> 00:05:09.525
- I'll just pop it down.

00:05:09.525 --> 00:05:10.495
That's quite good actually yeah.

00:05:10.495 --> 00:05:11.328
- Yeah thanks, yeah.

00:05:11.328 --> 00:05:12.476
- I thought that footage was tremendous.

00:05:12.476 --> 00:05:14.230
We actually had the perfect
amount of mouse traps

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.010
to visualize that sort
of inward chain reaction.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.220
- You would never have
guessed that either.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.053
- Yeah.

00:05:19.053 --> 00:05:19.886
- Who'd have thought that?

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:21.440
Because we covered every
square inch with a mousetrap

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.430
we could see exactly the reaction.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.270
- And in real time because
I was so adrenaline

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.590
and frantic about them
all going off by accident,

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.860
which they did while we
were setting them up,

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.050
I didn't really pay
attention to what order

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:32.883
it all happened in.

00:05:32.883 --> 00:05:33.716
I didn't even see it.

00:05:33.716 --> 00:05:35.940
- No, I think afterwards
you pushed the button

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.270
and you were panicking
because you were like

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.110
have we got everything.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:38.943
Did we get it?

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:42.120
Cause that was the
biggest amount of effort.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.677
That was probably an hour
per second of footage there.

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:47.530
- That took four hours to set it up

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.030
and we recorded for four seconds.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.140
- Yeah so an hour per second.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.950
- Thankfully our camera
can stretch one second into

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.120
several minutes.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:54.953
- Makes it worthwhile.

00:05:54.953 --> 00:05:56.160
- Using the right camera.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.530
Woo all right, well that's
quite short and sweet

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.370
but hopefully you enjoyed it.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.420
I always like those simple ideas.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.790
They're often my favorite ones.

